Section: 4.2. Performance Comparison of the Two
Text: 4.2. Performance Comparison of the Two Models in Form For Jueju and Lvshi of SHI, because of their simplicity in form, the two models hardly make form errors. We generate 500 poems for each type using the two models accordingly. All of these poems are in the right form. This demonstrates that both models are all very powerful in generating Jueju and Lvshi with almost perfect performance in form.

